# Local agent and editor state; nothing here is shareable.
# `.claude/skills/` is a SYMLINK into a separate skills repo, so committing it
# would capture a link, not content. `.claude/worktrees/` accumulates leftover
# agent worktrees and was 1.6 GB when this line was added — worth pruning
# periodically with `git worktree prune`.
